  "manifest_id": "operations-docusign_prospect_nda",
  "revision": "batch03_v1",
  "public_request": "We have some prospects waiting for technical demos but they need NDAs first. Can you send one to the highest-value prospect?\n\nCheck the Demo Requests sheet (ss_demos/ws_pending) for technical demo requests that require an NDA. The sheet has additional worksheets with NDA policies — check those before selecting. Pick the one with the highest estimated value.\n\nOnce you've identified the prospect:\n- Send them the 'Mutual NDA' template via DocuSign, cc legal@company.example.com\n- Log it in Airtable (base_sales/NDA Log)\n- Email the contact confirming the NDA has been sent",
